    "description": "Pricing for telephony services is more cost effective with a Voice Over Internet Protocol (VOIP) system. I gathered information on different types of systems and weighed the benefits of all of them to decide on a Premise based system that could cost effectively meet both our current and future needs. Using a free project management system (Asana.com) I was able to efficiently manage the migration from our Centrex phone system. A plan was developed outlining training schedules and dates for the cutover. While staying within the allotted time, We were able to transition to the new system smoothly. ",
